	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c07gym0101_leader_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ジムリーダーに
いどむ　こころの　じゅんび▽
できているようだな▼
では　いざ！[Ctrl2:PageClear ]</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ジムリーダーに　挑む
心の　準備▽
できているようだな▼
では　いざ！[Ctrl2:PageClear ]</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・戦闘前メッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>LEADER7</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c07gym0101_leader_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>つよき　こころを　もつものよ
これを　わたそう[Ctrl2:PageClear ]</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>強き　心を　持つものよ
これを　わたそう[Ctrl2:PageClear ]</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・戦闘後メッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
